esign Gengar a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7u pour rassembler et classer vos jeux de cartes pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s. Chaque PRO-Binder est dot\u00e9 d&#8217;une couverture rembourr\u00e9e en similicuir avec une fermeture \u00e9clair assortie et une languette. Le binder contient 20 pages avec chacune 12 pochettes side-loading de taille standard, dans lesquelles vous pouvez ranger jusqu&#8217;\u00e0 480 cartes dans des pochettes Ultra PRO Deck Protector. Les pages ont un fond noir qui donne aux cartes un aspect encadr\u00e9. Fabriqu\u00e9 \u00e0 partir de mat\u00e9riaux sans acide et sans PVC.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"5990","regular_price":"5990","sale_price":"5990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>59.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":30131,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribou.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribou-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribou.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribou-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribou-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Pokemon-Gengar-Elite-Series-12-Pocket-Zippered-PRO-Binder_001_PetitCaribo