\u00a0Pok\u00e9mon.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<p>La M\u00e9ga-\u00c9volution d\u00e9cuple la puissance du Pok\u00e9mon l\u00e9gendaire Latias\u00a0! Avec une incroyable rapidit\u00e9, il plonge du ciel avec une force draconique. Vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais faire \u00e9quipe avec M\u00e9ga-Latias-ex en tant que carte promo brillante pour le jeu, ainsi qu\u2019avec une carte lenticulaire grand format magnifiquement illustr\u00e9e. Vous obtiendrez \u00e9galement quatre boosters contenant davantage de Pok\u00e9mon.<\/p>\n<p>Le Coffret M\u00e9ga-Latias-ex du JCC\u00a0Pok\u00e9mon contient\u00a0:<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list\">\n<li>1\u00a0carte promo brillante de M\u00e9ga-Latias-ex\u00a0;<\/li>\n<li>1\u00a0carte promo grand format lenticulaire de M\u00e9ga-Latias-ex\u00a0;<\/li>\n<li>4\u00a0boosters du JCC\u00a0Pok\u00e9mon.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2990","regular_price":"2990","sale_price":"2990","price_range":null,"currency_code":"CHF","currency_symbol":"CHF","currency_minor_unit":2,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"CHF","currency_suffix":""},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#067;&#072;&#070;<\/span>29.90<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":28725,"src":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1-278x278.png","srcset":"https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1.png 1000w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1-278x278.png 278w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1-100x100.png 100w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Mega-Latias-ex-Box-1-501x501.png 501w, https:\/\/lepetitcaribou.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06